	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Type `hn` followed by anything to search your Hermes blocks.

Results come from Talaria's local mirror, so this works with no network at all. Alfred cannot see these through the system index — CoreSpotlight items and file metadata are separate stores — so the workflow asks the daemon directly.

Return opens the block in the web app. Cmd-Return opens it via talaria://, which resolves the host at click time.

Requires the talaria daemon to be running: `talaria doctor` will say.</string>
